# Deterministic line endings regardless of any individual clone's own
# core.autocrlf setting - this repo is developed on Windows but its CI
# (.github/workflows/ci.yml, release.yml) runs these shell scripts on a
# Linux runner, where a stray \r in a shebang or script body can break
# execution outright.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
